# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: The following items are NOT ignored intentionally:
# - ai-service/rice_disease_model.keras: The main CNN model is ~23MB 
#   (well under Git's 100MB limit). It is directly required for the 
#   predict route to function and isn't dynamically downloaded on deploy.
# - backend/chroma_db/: The RAG database holds pre-populated vector 
#   embeddings. Since `rag_service.py` simply reads from it and does 
#   not populate it dynamically at runtime, it must be included for 
#   the RAG queries to work in a deployment environment.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
